{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>This game is not suitable for children or those who are easily disturbed.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/fc460a2a1fa3aadf2873557d52005516.poster.avif?t=1756135524\" width=1138 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/fc460a2a1fa3aadf2873557d52005516.webm?t=1756135524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/fc460a2a1fa3aadf2873557d52005516.mp4?t=1756135524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something is watching you. Something is waiting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in the dead of night, you find yourself sent on a simple errand\u2014to check on a quiet gas station on the outskirts of town. But nothing here <strong>feels right</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The air is heavy with something unspoken, the radio crackles with words that don't belong, and the station itself... <strong>shifts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step forward drags you deeper into a <strong>nightmare of fractured reality and unseen terrors</strong>. Strange voices whisper in your ear, shadows stretch and writhe, and <strong>the choices you make will carve your fate</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you listen? Will you obey? Or will you resist, knowing that every decision carries a price?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/9b44d5ef10f008b31dd4ab5a69465756.poster.avif?t=1756135524\" width=1138 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/9b44d5ef10f008b31dd4ab5a69465756.webm?t=1756135524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/9b44d5ef10f008b31dd4ab5a69465756.mp4?t=1756135524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 Experience a slow-burning descent into paranoia, dread, and disturbing imagery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision-Based Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Every choice you make alters the experience, shaping the horrors that unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Pixel Art</strong> \u2013 A haunting, detailed world brought to life with eerie animations and lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Sound Design</strong> \u2013 A chilling original soundtrack and unnerving ambient sounds that react to your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Your fate is not set. Discover different outcomes depending on your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short Duration</strong> \u2013 A\u00a0~30 minutes experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/cbccb3ecae66dea83da75df2583fc1d3.poster.avif?t=1756135524\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/cbccb3ecae66dea83da75df2583fc1d3.webm?t=1756135524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/extras/cbccb3ecae66dea83da75df2583fc1d3.mp4?t=1756135524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn't a place you can escape by running. Something <i>wants</i> you here. And it <i>will</i> make sure you stay.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3489460?t=1756135524","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756135524","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/867a99f21edf2c5e83c9f0e98dbe95b41bf7c8ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756135524","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489460/867a99f21edf2c5e83c9f0e98dbe95b41bf7c8ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756135524","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains themes and depictions that may not be suitable for all audiences. Players will encounter:\r\n\r\n-Psychological horror elements, including intense and unsettling scenarios.\r\n-Depictions of violence and references to death, presented in a pixel art style.\r\n-Disturbing dialogue and scenarios involving coercion, threats, and psychological manipulation.\r\n-Themes of self-harm and sacrifice, presented as part of the narrative choices.\r\n-Mild references to alcohol usage in dialogue or environmental storytel